From dc52d1b4f7b5503842baca7535c4c51b8236c3d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:21:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sensors): group the details popover into tabs

The popover stacked every category in one tall column that reached the
dock on a 16 inch panel. Group the rows into CPU, Processor, Memory &
Storage and Hardware tabs with a SegmentedControl over a Gtk.Stack,
leave out empty tabs, and keep the selected tab across refreshes.

Raise the per-group row cap from 6 to 12 so a 12-core CPU is shown in
full, and cap the height at the space between the chip and the dock.

